UPDATE companies SET description='Somerville Industries was founded in 1968 in Mineral Wells, West Virginia, and remains a family-owned business led by the Somerville family. The company serves as the parent organization for Somerville Fabricators and Somerville Manufacturing, operating from two locations that include a second facility in Devola, Ohio.

The company provides full-service manufacturing and fabrication in carbon steel and stainless steel, offering custom structural steel fabrication, detailing, and on-time delivery. With 45 employees across 55,000 square feet of combined fabrication space, Somerville Industries produces more than 4,000 tons of steel products annually.

Somerville Industries serves customers throughout the Mid-West and Mid-Atlantic regions of the United States as well as Canada.

The company''s stated differentiator is its family-owned culture and the motto "Where Quality is our Character," emphasizing personal relationships with customers and staff from quoting through delivery.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Custom Structural Steel Fabrication", "Stainless Steel Fabrication", "Carbon Steel Fabrication", "Detailing", "On-time Delivery"], "industries": [], "materials": ["Stainless Steel", "Carbon Steel"], "equipment": [], "volume": "Over 4,000 tons annually", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Family-owned since 1968", "55,000 sq ft combined fabrication space across two locations", "Produces over 4,000 tons of steel products annually", "Services Mid-West, Mid-Atlantic, and Canada", "Full fabrication from detailing to on-time delivery"], "facts_used": ["Founded 1968 -> /about", "Family-owned -> /about", "45 employees -> /about", "Two locations: Mineral Wells, WV and Devola, OH -> /about", "55,000 sq ft combined fabrication space -> /about", "Produces over 4,000 tons annually -> /about", "Full fabrication services in stainless and carbon steel -> /", "Custom Structural Steel Fabrication -> db", "Services Mid-West, Mid-Atlantic, Canada -> /about", "Parent company of Somerville Fabricators and Somerville Manufacturing -> /", "Motto: Where Quality is our Character -> /about"], "company_type": "Manufacturer", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "We are a full-service manufacturer and fabricator of carbon steel and stainless steel", "founded_year": "1968", "employee_count": "45", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": [], "ownership_tags": ["Family-owned"]}'::jsonb, updated_at=now() WHERE slug='somerville-industries' AND approved AND profile IS NULL;
UPDATE companies SET description='Sonix Inc is headquartered in Springfield, Virginia, and has been operating since 1986. The company was founded as a pioneer in scanning acoustic microscopy for semiconductor defect detection. Today it operates as part of Tektronix, backed by Ralliant, a $6 billion diversified industrial growth company.

Sonix designs and manufactures the ECHO line of scanning acoustic microscopes used for nondestructive inspection of bonded wafers, packaged semiconductors, and industrial materials. Its systems deliver high-resolution subsurface imaging at production speeds, with automated wafer handling and sorting for pass/fail decisions. The product portfolio covers wafer inspection, package inspection, and industrial inspection applications, supported by a global network of sales, service, application engineering, and training facilities.

Its microscopes are deployed from development labs to high-volume production floors worldwide.

