UPDATE companies SET description='Spartan Home Pros was founded in 2020 and is headquartered in Hazlet, New Jersey, with additional offices in Bridgewater and Chatham. The company operates as a licensed and insured electrical and HVAC service provider under New Jersey Electrical Contractor Business Permit #34EB01810700, serving residential and commercial customers across Central New Jersey.

The firm provides a full range of electrical services including panel upgrades (100‑amp to 200‑amp), EV charger installation for brands such as Tesla, ChargePoint, and Ford, emergency repair, new circuit wiring, lighting and ceiling‑fan installation, whole‑home generator systems (as an authorized Generac installer), surge protection, and electrical inspections. Commercial work covers tenant fit‑outs, three‑phase distribution, lighting retrofits, and code corrections, while a dedicated older‑home division handles fuse‑box replacement, knob‑and‑tube rewiring, and Federal Pacific/Zinsco panel swaps. All work is performed by the company’s own crews; no subcontractors are used.

Customers include homeowners, retail storefronts, restaurants, cafes, salons, dental and medical practices, professional offices, and industrial facilities such as warehouses and production plants requiring high‑bay lighting. The company’s certified installer status for Tesla, ChargePoint, Emporia, and Lutron controls, together with its Generac authorization, allows it to support EV‑charging infrastructure and backup‑power projects across the region.

Spartan Home Pros differentiates itself with flat, upfront pricing that eliminates hourly meters, a permit‑handling service that files with local townships, and 24/7 emergency response answered around the clock. The two physical office locations in Hazlet and Bridgewater ensure local coverage rather than a broad service radius drawn from a distant base.', certifications=ARRAY['NJ Electrical Contractor Business Permit #34EB01810700','Tesla Certified Installer','ChargePoint Certified Installer','Emporia Certified Installer','Lutron Certified Installer','Generac Authorized Installer']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Electrical panel upgrades (100\u2011amp to 200\u2011amp, sub\u2011panels, meter can repairs)", "EV charger installation (Level 2, Tesla, ChargePoint, Ford, Rivian, Emporia)", "Emergency electrical repair (24/7)", "New circuit wiring (dedicated appliance circuits, kitchen/bath, basement build\u2011outs, aluminum wiring corrections)", "Lighting installation (recessed, chandeliers, exterior, landscape, high\u2011bay)", "Ceiling fan installation (fan\u2011rated boxes, bracing, sloped ceilings, outdoor\u2011rated)", "Generator installation (whole\u2011home standby, automatic transfer switches, Generac authorized)", "Whole\u2011home surge protection (panel\u2011mounted Type 2)", "Home electrical inspections (pre\u2011purchase, pre\u2011sale, safety audits)", "Commercial electrical (tenant fit\u2011outs, three\u2011phase distribution, lighting retrofits, code corrections)", "Older home electrical specialties (fuse box replacement, 60\u2011amp upgrades, knob\u2011and\u2011tube rewiring, Federal Pacific/Zinsco panel replacement, two\u2011prong outlet replacement, grounding, smoke/CO alarm installation, attic fan, high\u2011ceiling lighting)"], "industries": ["Residential", "Retail", "Restaurants & Food Service", "Personal Care (salons)", "Healthcare (dental, medical practices)", "Professional Offices", "Industrial (warehouses, production facilities, distributio