UPDATE companies SET description='Stanford Manufacturing operates from two facilities totaling over 100,000 square feet in Clemmons, North Carolina. The company traces its molding expertise back more than six decades, though a specific founding year is not publicly disclosed.

The company specializes in custom plastic injection molding, supported by automation and assembly, packaging, labeling, and shipping services. Its capabilities include multi-color molding, decorating and joining technologies, barcode traceability, automated vision inspection with touch probes, and leak detection. Production volumes range from 100 to over 10 million parts annually.

Stanford serves industries including waste bins and totes, aerospace and defense, consumer goods, electrical, industrial products, and agriculture. Long-term customers cited include Battery Watering Technologies (over eight years), Faircloth Machine Shop, Pronet Solutions, and Xtreme Defense Face Shield.

The company emphasizes precision, flexibility, and full-service integration from molding through final shipment. It highlights its ISO 9001 and AS9100D certifications, consolidated logistics, and a workforce recognized by the Triad''s Best Places to Work award.', certifications=ARRAY['ISO 9001','AS9100D']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Plastic injection molding", "Automation and assembly", "Packaging and shipping", "Product labeling", "Custom decorating and joining technologies", "Barcode reading for traceability", "Automated vision inspection with touch probe", "Leak detection testing", "Multi-color molding", "Tooling management"], "industries": ["Waste Bins & Totes", "Aerospace & Defense", "Consumer Goods", "Electrical", "Industrial Products", "Agriculture"], "materials": [], "equipment": ["Automated vision system with touch probe", "Leak detection technology", "Barcode reading system"], "volume": "100 to 10,000,000+ parts", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Consolidated 100,000+ sqft facility reducing logistical costs and supply chain complexity", "Automated vision systems with touch probe and leak detection for advanced quality control", "Full-service offering from molding through assembly, packaging, and shipping", "Production scale spanning 100 to 10,000,000+ parts", "ISO 9001 and AS9100D certified quality management"], "facts_used": ["Location: Clemmons, NC -> /", "Facility size: 100,000+ sqft across two locations -> /", "Certifications: ISO 9001, AS9100D -> /", "Core capabilities: plastic injection molding, automation, assembly, packaging, labeling, vision inspection, leak detection, barcode reading, multi-color molding, decorating/joining -> /", "Industries served: waste bins & totes, aerospace & defense, consumer goods, electrical, industrial products, agriculture -> /", "Production scale: 100 to 10,000,000+ parts -> /", "Customer examples: Battery Watering Technologies, Faircloth Machine Shop, Pronet Solutions, Xtreme Defense Face Shi